<main class="page">
<h1>Parameterized and Exact Algorithms and Reductions</h1>
<p style="margin-top: 12px; max-width: 760px">PEAR catalogues NP-hard problems, the reductions between them and the fastest known exact and parameterized algorithms, including bounds derived automatically by chaining reductions. Every result cites an openly readable source and the exact statement it relies on.</p>

<h2>Pilot problems</h2>
<p class="note">Best classical bounds for the default version: randomized and non-constructive algorithms allowed, quantum algorithms and results from unrefereed sources left out.</p>
